lox init: /project

Prerequisites
  ok  Docker 29.0.0
  ok  cosign v2.6.1 (lox add and lox run verify every image's signature)
  ok  lea
  ok  launchers: locksql, lockmq, lockfile, lockhttp, locklog, lockssh

lockfamily.yaml declares locks, kept as they are: orders (locksql)

[lox up]

Ready. Run `lea` (or `claude` + `lox approve`). Add a source: `lox add locksql|lockmq|lockfile|lockhttp|locklog|lockssh`.
